# CODEOWNERS — review requirements for governancer-foundation/funnel-base-mcp.
#
# Each line maps a file/dir glob to a GitHub user/team that must review
# changes. More-specific patterns later in this file override earlier ones.
#
# NOTE: the @governancer-foundation/maintainers team must EXIST in the
# governancer-foundation organisation for these rules to take effect. Until
# the team is created, GitHub silently ignores the unresolvable owner and
# the primary maintainer is the effective reviewer. Create the team before
# enabling "Require review from Code Owners" branch protection.

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default: maintainers review everything
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                               @governancer-foundation/maintainers

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server source — strictest review (path-handling, no-egress invariant)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/src/                           @governancer-foundation/maintainers

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Governance + docs
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/README.md                      @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                    @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md                  @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/NOTICE                         @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/LICENSE                        @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/REUSE.toml                     @governancer-foundation/maintainers

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CI / supply-chain — security-sensitive
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/workflows/             @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/.github/dependabot.yml         @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/CODEOWNERS                     @governancer-foundation/maintainers
/scripts/                       @governancer-foundation/maintainers
